---
title: How to Integrate TanStack Router with Shadcn/ui
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This guide covers setting up Shadcn/ui with TanStack Router, including solutions for common animation and compatibility issues."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick Start"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Time Required:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 30-45 minutes\n"},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Difficulty:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Intermediate\n"},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prerequisites:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Existing TanStack Router project"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"what-you-ll-accomplish","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What You'll Accomplish"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install and configure Shadcn/ui with TanStack Router"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fix animation issues with modals, sheets, and dialogs"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create type-safe navigation components"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Set up proper styling integration"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resolve common compatibility problems"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation-and-setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation and Setup"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-1-install-shadcn-ui","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 1: Install Shadcn/ui"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option 1: New project with TanStack Router template"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"npx create-tsrouter-app@latest my-app --template file-router --tailwind --add-ons shadcn","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Option 2: Add to existing TanStack Router project"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"npx shadcn@latest init","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-2-configure-components-json","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 2: Configure components.json"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create or update your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"components.json"},{"type":"text","value":" for TanStack Router compatibility:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json\",\n  \"style\": \"default\",\n  \"rsc\": false,\n  \"tsx\": true,\n  \"tailwind\": {\n    \"config\": \"tailwind.config.js\",\n    \"css\": \"src/app/globals.css\",\n    \"baseColor\": \"slate\",\n    \"cssVariables\": true\n  },\n  \"aliases\": {\n    \"components\": \"@/components\",\n    \"utils\": \"@/lib/utils\"\n  }\n}","lang":"json"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-3-add-essential-components","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 3: Add Essential Components"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the most commonly used components:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npx shadcn@latest add button\nnpx shadcn@latest add navigation-menu\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog","lang":"bash"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"fixing-animation-issues","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Fixing Animation Issues"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-1-set-up-proper-dom-structure","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 1: Set Up Proper DOM Structure"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Update your root route to support portals and animations:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/routes/__root.tsx\nimport { createRootRoute, Outlet } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nexport const Route = createRootRoute({\n  component: () => (\n    <>\n      {/* Main content wrapper */}\n      <div id=\"root-content\">\n        <Outlet />\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Portal root for overlays */}\n      <div id=\"portal-root\"></div>\n\n      <TanStackRouterDevtools />\n    </>\n  ),\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-2-create-router-compatible-sheet-component","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Sheet Component"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shadcn/ui Sheet components can have animation issues. Create a wrapper:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/components/ui/router-sheet.tsx\nimport * as React from 'react'\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from '@/components/ui/sheet'\n\ninterface RouterSheetProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  trigger: React.ReactNode\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  onOpenChange?: (open: boolean) => void\n}\n\nexport function RouterSheet({\n  children,\n  trigger,\n  title,\n  description,\n  onOpenChange,\n}: RouterSheetProps) {\n  const [open, setOpen] = React.useState(false)\n\n  const handleOpenChange = (newOpen: boolean) => {\n    setOpen(newOpen)\n    onOpenChange?.(newOpen)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Sheet open={open} onOpenChange={handleOpenChange}>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>{trigger}</SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>{title}</SheetTitle>\n          {description && <SheetDescription>{description}</SheetDescription>}\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"mt-4\">{children}</div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-3-create-router-compatible-dialog-component","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 3: Create Router-Compatible Dialog Component"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/components/ui/router-dialog.tsx\nimport * as React from 'react'\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from '@/components/ui/dialog'\n\ninterface RouterDialogProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  trigger: React.ReactNode\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  open?: boolean\n  onOpenChange?: (open: boolean) => void\n}\n\nexport function RouterDialog({\n  children,\n  trigger,\n  title,\n  description,\n  open: controlledOpen,\n  onOpenChange,\n}: RouterDialogProps) {\n  const [internalOpen, setInternalOpen] = React.useState(false)\n\n  const open = controlledOpen ?? internalOpen\n  const setOpen = onOpenChange ?? setInternalOpen\n\n  return (\n    <Dialog open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>{trigger}</DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent>\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>{title}</DialogTitle>\n          {description && <DialogDescription>{description}</DialogDescription>}\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"mt-4\">{children}</div>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"creating-navigation-components","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creating Navigation Components"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-1-router-compatible-navigation-menu","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 1: Router-Compatible Navigation Menu"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/components/navigation/main-nav.tsx\nimport { Link, useMatchRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { cn } from '@/lib/utils'\nimport {\n  NavigationMenu,\n  NavigationMenuItem,\n  NavigationMenuLink,\n  NavigationMenuList,\n  navigationMenuTriggerStyle,\n} from '@/components/ui/navigation-menu'\n\ninterface NavItem {\n  to: string\n  label: string\n  exact?: boolean\n}\n\ninterface MainNavProps {\n  items: NavItem[]\n  className?: string\n}\n\nexport function MainNav({ items, className }: MainNavProps) {\n  const matchRoute = useMatchRoute()\n\n  return (\n    <NavigationMenu className={className}>\n      <NavigationMenuList>\n        {items.map((item) => {\n          const isActive = matchRoute({ to: item.to, fuzzy: !item.exact })\n\n          return (\n            <NavigationMenuItem key={item.to}>\n              <Link\n                to={item.to}\n                className={cn(\n                  navigationMenuTriggerStyle(),\n                  isActive && 'bg-accent text-accent-foreground font-medium',\n                )}\n              >\n                {item.label}\n              </Link>\n            </NavigationMenuItem>\n          )\n        })}\n      </NavigationMenuList>\n    </NavigationMenu>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-2-create-router-compatible-button-links","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Button Links"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/components/ui/router-button.tsx\nimport { createLink } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { Button, type ButtonProps } from '@/components/ui/button'\nimport { forwardRef } from 'react'\n\n// Create a router-compatible Button\nexport const RouterButton = createLink(\n  forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>((props, ref) => {\n    return <Button ref={ref} {...props} />\n  }),\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"step-3-usage-example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Step 3: Usage Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/routes/posts/index.tsx\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { MainNav } from '@/components/navigation/main-nav'\nimport { RouterButton } from '@/components/ui/router-button'\nimport { RouterSheet } from '@/components/ui/router-sheet'\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/')({\n  component: PostsPage,\n})\n\nconst navItems = [\n  { to: '/', label: 'Home' },\n  { to: '/posts', label: 'Posts', exact: true },\n  { to: '/about', label: 'About' },\n]\n\nfunction PostsPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-4\">\n      {/* Navigation with active states */}\n      <MainNav items={navItems} className=\"mb-8\" />\n\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n        <h1 className=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Posts</h1>\n\n        {/* Router-compatible button */}\n        <RouterButton to=\"/posts/new\" variant=\"default\">\n          Create Post\n        </RouterButton>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Sheet with proper animations */}\n      <RouterSheet\n        trigger={<Button variant=\"outline\">Open Menu</Button>}\n        title=\"Navigation Menu\"\n        description=\"Navigate through your posts\"\n      >\n        <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <p>This sheet animates correctly with TanStack Router!</p>\n          <RouterButton to=\"/posts/new\" variant=\"default\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Create New Post\n          </RouterButton>\n        </div>\n      </RouterSheet>\n    </div>\n  )\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"common-problems","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Common Problems"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"animation-components-not-working","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Animation Components Not Working"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Sheet, Dialog, or other animated components don't animate properly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solutions:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"loose":true,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ensure proper portal setup:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"// Add to your index.html or root component\n<div id=\"portal-root\"></div>","lang":"tsx"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check CSS imports order:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* Make sure this comes before your custom styles */\n@import 'tailwindcss/base';\n@import 'tailwindcss/components';\n@import 'tailwindcss/utilities';","lang":"css"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use controlled components for complex animations:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"const [open, setOpen] = useState(false)\n\n// Controlled instead of uncontrolled\n<Sheet open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>","lang":"tsx"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"typescript-errors-with-router-integration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeScript Errors with Router Integration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" TypeScript errors when using Shadcn/ui components with TanStack Router."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createLink"},{"type":"text","value":" for proper typing:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createLink } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'\n\n// This provides full type safety\nexport const RouterButton = createLink(Button)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"styling-conflicts","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Styling Conflicts"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Shadcn/ui styles conflict with router or custom styles."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solutions:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"loose":true,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use CSS layers:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"@layer base, components, utilities;\n\n@layer base {\n  /* Shadcn/ui base styles */\n}\n\n@layer components {\n  /* Your component styles */\n}","lang":"css"}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Increase specificity for router-specific styles:"}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"<Button className=\"router-active:bg-primary router-active:text-primary-foreground\">\n  Active Button\n</Button>","lang":"tsx"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"dark-mode-integration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark Mode Integration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Problem:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Dark mode doesn't work properly with route changes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solution:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" Set up theme provider correctly:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// src/components/theme-provider.tsx\nimport { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState } from 'react'\n\ntype Theme = 'dark' | 'light' | 'system'\n\ninterface ThemeProviderProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTheme?: Theme\n  storageKey?: string\n}\n\nconst ThemeProviderContext = createContext<{\n  theme: Theme\n  setTheme: (theme: Theme) => void\n}>({\n  theme: 'system',\n  setTheme: () => null,\n})\n\nexport function ThemeProvider({\n  children,\n  defaultTheme = 'system',\n  storageKey = 'ui-theme',\n}: ThemeProviderProps) {\n  const [theme, setTheme] = useState<Theme>(\n    () => (localStorage.getItem(storageKey) as Theme) || defaultTheme,\n  )\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const root = window.document.documentElement\n    root.classList.remove('light', 'dark')\n\n    if (theme === 'system') {\n      const systemTheme = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)')\n        .matches\n        ? 'dark'\n        : 'light'\n      root.classList.add(systemTheme)\n      return\n    }\n\n    root.classList.add(theme)\n  }, [theme])\n\n  const value = {\n    theme,\n    setTheme: (theme: Theme) => {\n      localStorage.setItem(storageKey, theme)\n      setTheme(theme)\n    },\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <ThemeProviderContext.Provider value={value}>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeProviderContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport const useTheme = () => {\n  const context = useContext(ThemeProviderContext)\n  if (context === undefined)\n    throw new Error('useTheme must be used within a ThemeProvider')\n  return context\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"production-checklist","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Production Checklist"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before deploying your Shadcn/ui + TanStack Router app:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"styling","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Styling"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All Shadcn/ui components render correctly"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Animations work properly on route changes"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dark mode integration working (if applicable)"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CSS conflicts resolved"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Responsive design tested"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"functionality","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Functionality"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Navigation components work with router state"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Active states properly reflected"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TypeScript compilation successful"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All sheets, dialogs, and modals animate correctly"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"performance","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Performance"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bundle size optimized (tree shaking working)"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"CSS-in-JS not causing performance issues"}]}],"checked":false},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Animation performance acceptable on slower devices"}]}],"checked":false}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"related-resources","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Related Resources"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/installation/tanstack-router","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shadcn/ui TanStack Router Installation"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Official integration guide"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../api/router#createlink","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Router createLink API"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - API documentation for component integration"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shadcn/ui Components"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Complete component documentation"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"quick-start","text":"Quick Start","level":2},{"id":"what-you-ll-accomplish","text":"What You'll Accomplish","level":3},{"id":"installation-and-setup","text":"Installation and Setup","level":2},{"id":"step-1-install-shadcn-ui","text":"Step 1: Install Shadcn/ui","level":3},{"id":"step-2-configure-components-json","text":"Step 2: Configure components.json","level":3},{"id":"step-3-add-essential-components","text":"Step 3: Add Essential Components","level":3},{"id":"fixing-animation-issues","text":"Fixing Animation Issues","level":2},{"id":"step-1-set-up-proper-dom-structure","text":"Step 1: Set Up Proper DOM Structure","level":3},{"id":"step-2-create-router-compatible-sheet-component","text":"Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Sheet Component","level":3},{"id":"step-3-create-router-compatible-dialog-component","text":"Step 3: Create Router-Compatible Dialog Component","level":3},{"id":"creating-navigation-components","text":"Creating Navigation Components","level":2},{"id":"step-1-router-compatible-navigation-menu","text":"Step 1: Router-Compatible Navigation Menu","level":3},{"id":"step-2-create-router-compatible-button-links","text":"Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Button Links","level":3},{"id":"step-3-usage-example","text":"Step 3: Usage Example","level":3},{"id":"common-problems","text":"Common Problems","level":2},{"id":"animation-components-not-working","text":"Animation Components Not Working","level":3},{"id":"typescript-errors-with-router-integration","text":"TypeScript Errors with Router Integration","level":3},{"id":"styling-conflicts","text":"Styling Conflicts","level":3},{"id":"dark-mode-integration","text":"Dark Mode Integration","level":3},{"id":"production-checklist","text":"Production Checklist","level":2},{"id":"styling","text":"Styling","level":3},{"id":"functionality","text":"Functionality","level":3},{"id":"performance","text":"Performance","level":3},{"id":"related-resources","text":"Related Resources","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThis guide covers setting up Shadcn/ui with TanStack Router, including solutions for common animation and compatibility issues.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Time Required:** 30-45 minutes  \n**Difficulty:** Intermediate  \n**Prerequisites:** Existing TanStack Router project\n\n### What You'll Accomplish\n\n- Install and configure Shadcn/ui with TanStack Router\n- Fix animation issues with modals, sheets, and dialogs\n- Create type-safe navigation components\n- Set up proper styling integration\n- Resolve common compatibility problems\n\n---\n\n## Installation and Setup\n\n### Step 1: Install Shadcn/ui\n\n**Option 1: New project with TanStack Router template**\n\n```bash\nnpx create-tsrouter-app@latest my-app --template file-router --tailwind --add-ons shadcn\n```\n\n**Option 2: Add to existing TanStack Router project**\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n### Step 2: Configure components.json\n\nCreate or update your `components.json` for TanStack Router compatibility:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json\",\n  \"style\": \"default\",\n  \"rsc\": false,\n  \"tsx\": true,\n  \"tailwind\": {\n    \"config\": \"tailwind.config.js\",\n    \"css\": \"src/app/globals.css\",\n    \"baseColor\": \"slate\",\n    \"cssVariables\": true\n  },\n  \"aliases\": {\n    \"components\": \"@/components\",\n    \"utils\": \"@/lib/utils\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Add Essential Components\n\nInstall the most commonly used components:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\nnpx shadcn@latest add navigation-menu\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\n---\n\n## Fixing Animation Issues\n\n### Step 1: Set Up Proper DOM Structure\n\nUpdate your root route to support portals and animations:\n\n```tsx\n// src/routes/__root.tsx\nimport { createRootRoute, Outlet } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nexport const Route = createRootRoute({\n  component: () => (\n    <>\n      {/* Main content wrapper */}\n      <div id=\"root-content\">\n        <Outlet />\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Portal root for overlays */}\n      <div id=\"portal-root\"></div>\n\n      <TanStackRouterDevtools />\n    </>\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Sheet Component\n\nShadcn/ui Sheet components can have animation issues. Create a wrapper:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/router-sheet.tsx\nimport * as React from 'react'\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from '@/components/ui/sheet'\n\ninterface RouterSheetProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  trigger: React.ReactNode\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  onOpenChange?: (open: boolean) => void\n}\n\nexport function RouterSheet({\n  children,\n  trigger,\n  title,\n  description,\n  onOpenChange,\n}: RouterSheetProps) {\n  const [open, setOpen] = React.useState(false)\n\n  const handleOpenChange = (newOpen: boolean) => {\n    setOpen(newOpen)\n    onOpenChange?.(newOpen)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Sheet open={open} onOpenChange={handleOpenChange}>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>{trigger}</SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>{title}</SheetTitle>\n          {description && <SheetDescription>{description}</SheetDescription>}\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"mt-4\">{children}</div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Router-Compatible Dialog Component\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/router-dialog.tsx\nimport * as React from 'react'\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from '@/components/ui/dialog'\n\ninterface RouterDialogProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  trigger: React.ReactNode\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  open?: boolean\n  onOpenChange?: (open: boolean) => void\n}\n\nexport function RouterDialog({\n  children,\n  trigger,\n  title,\n  description,\n  open: controlledOpen,\n  onOpenChange,\n}: RouterDialogProps) {\n  const [internalOpen, setInternalOpen] = React.useState(false)\n\n  const open = controlledOpen ?? internalOpen\n  const setOpen = onOpenChange ?? setInternalOpen\n\n  return (\n    <Dialog open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>{trigger}</DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent>\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>{title}</DialogTitle>\n          {description && <DialogDescription>{description}</DialogDescription>}\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"mt-4\">{children}</div>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Creating Navigation Components\n\n### Step 1: Router-Compatible Navigation Menu\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/navigation/main-nav.tsx\nimport { Link, useMatchRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { cn } from '@/lib/utils'\nimport {\n  NavigationMenu,\n  NavigationMenuItem,\n  NavigationMenuLink,\n  NavigationMenuList,\n  navigationMenuTriggerStyle,\n} from '@/components/ui/navigation-menu'\n\ninterface NavItem {\n  to: string\n  label: string\n  exact?: boolean\n}\n\ninterface MainNavProps {\n  items: NavItem[]\n  className?: string\n}\n\nexport function MainNav({ items, className }: MainNavProps) {\n  const matchRoute = useMatchRoute()\n\n  return (\n    <NavigationMenu className={className}>\n      <NavigationMenuList>\n        {items.map((item) => {\n          const isActive = matchRoute({ to: item.to, fuzzy: !item.exact })\n\n          return (\n            <NavigationMenuItem key={item.to}>\n              <Link\n                to={item.to}\n                className={cn(\n                  navigationMenuTriggerStyle(),\n                  isActive && 'bg-accent text-accent-foreground font-medium',\n                )}\n              >\n                {item.label}\n              </Link>\n            </NavigationMenuItem>\n          )\n        })}\n      </NavigationMenuList>\n    </NavigationMenu>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Button Links\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/router-button.tsx\nimport { createLink } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { Button, type ButtonProps } from '@/components/ui/button'\nimport { forwardRef } from 'react'\n\n// Create a router-compatible Button\nexport const RouterButton = createLink(\n  forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>((props, ref) => {\n    return <Button ref={ref} {...props} />\n  }),\n)\n```\n\n### Step 3: Usage Example\n\n```tsx\n// src/routes/posts/index.tsx\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { MainNav } from '@/components/navigation/main-nav'\nimport { RouterButton } from '@/components/ui/router-button'\nimport { RouterSheet } from '@/components/ui/router-sheet'\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/')({\n  component: PostsPage,\n})\n\nconst navItems = [\n  { to: '/', label: 'Home' },\n  { to: '/posts', label: 'Posts', exact: true },\n  { to: '/about', label: 'About' },\n]\n\nfunction PostsPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-4\">\n      {/* Navigation with active states */}\n      <MainNav items={navItems} className=\"mb-8\" />\n\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n        <h1 className=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Posts</h1>\n\n        {/* Router-compatible button */}\n        <RouterButton to=\"/posts/new\" variant=\"default\">\n          Create Post\n        </RouterButton>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Sheet with proper animations */}\n      <RouterSheet\n        trigger={<Button variant=\"outline\">Open Menu</Button>}\n        title=\"Navigation Menu\"\n        description=\"Navigate through your posts\"\n      >\n        <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <p>This sheet animates correctly with TanStack Router!</p>\n          <RouterButton to=\"/posts/new\" variant=\"default\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Create New Post\n          </RouterButton>\n        </div>\n      </RouterSheet>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Problems\n\n### Animation Components Not Working\n\n**Problem:** Sheet, Dialog, or other animated components don't animate properly.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Ensure proper portal setup:**\n\n   ```tsx\n   // Add to your index.html or root component\n   <div id=\"portal-root\"></div>\n   ```\n\n2. **Check CSS imports order:**\n\n   ```css\n   /* Make sure this comes before your custom styles */\n   @import 'tailwindcss/base';\n   @import 'tailwindcss/components';\n   @import 'tailwindcss/utilities';\n   ```\n\n3. **Use controlled components for complex animations:**\n\n   ```tsx\n   const [open, setOpen] = useState(false)\n\n   // Controlled instead of uncontrolled\n   <Sheet open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n   ```\n\n### TypeScript Errors with Router Integration\n\n**Problem:** TypeScript errors when using Shadcn/ui components with TanStack Router.\n\n**Solution:** Use `createLink` for proper typing:\n\n```tsx\nimport { createLink } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'\n\n// This provides full type safety\nexport const RouterButton = createLink(Button)\n```\n\n### Styling Conflicts\n\n**Problem:** Shadcn/ui styles conflict with router or custom styles.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Use CSS layers:**\n\n   ```css\n   @layer base, components, utilities;\n\n   @layer base {\n     /* Shadcn/ui base styles */\n   }\n\n   @layer components {\n     /* Your component styles */\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Increase specificity for router-specific styles:**\n   ```tsx\n   <Button className=\"router-active:bg-primary router-active:text-primary-foreground\">\n     Active Button\n   </Button>\n   ```\n\n### Dark Mode Integration\n\n**Problem:** Dark mode doesn't work properly with route changes.\n\n**Solution:** Set up theme provider correctly:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/theme-provider.tsx\nimport { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState } from 'react'\n\ntype Theme = 'dark' | 'light' | 'system'\n\ninterface ThemeProviderProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTheme?: Theme\n  storageKey?: string\n}\n\nconst ThemeProviderContext = createContext<{\n  theme: Theme\n  setTheme: (theme: Theme) => void\n}>({\n  theme: 'system',\n  setTheme: () => null,\n})\n\nexport function ThemeProvider({\n  children,\n  defaultTheme = 'system',\n  storageKey = 'ui-theme',\n}: ThemeProviderProps) {\n  const [theme, setTheme] = useState<Theme>(\n    () => (localStorage.getItem(storageKey) as Theme) || defaultTheme,\n  )\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const root = window.document.documentElement\n    root.classList.remove('light', 'dark')\n\n    if (theme === 'system') {\n      const systemTheme = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)')\n        .matches\n        ? 'dark'\n        : 'light'\n      root.classList.add(systemTheme)\n      return\n    }\n\n    root.classList.add(theme)\n  }, [theme])\n\n  const value = {\n    theme,\n    setTheme: (theme: Theme) => {\n      localStorage.setItem(storageKey, theme)\n      setTheme(theme)\n    },\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <ThemeProviderContext.Provider value={value}>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeProviderContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport const useTheme = () => {\n  const context = useContext(ThemeProviderContext)\n  if (context === undefined)\n    throw new Error('useTheme must be used within a ThemeProvider')\n  return context\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\nBefore deploying your Shadcn/ui + TanStack Router app:\n\n### Styling\n\n- [ ] All Shadcn/ui components render correctly\n- [ ] Animations work properly on route changes\n- [ ] Dark mode integration working (if applicable)\n- [ ] CSS conflicts resolved\n- [ ] Responsive design tested\n\n### Functionality\n\n- [ ] Navigation components work with router state\n- [ ] Active states properly reflected\n- [ ] TypeScript compilation successful\n- [ ] All sheets, dialogs, and modals animate correctly\n\n### Performance\n\n- [ ] Bundle size optimized (tree shaking working)\n- [ ] CSS-in-JS not causing performance issues\n- [ ] Animation performance acceptable on slower devices\n\n---\n\n## Related Resources\n\n- [Shadcn/ui TanStack Router Installation](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/installation/tanstack-router) - Official integration guide\n- [TanStack Router createLink API](../api/router#createlink) - API documentation for component integration\n- [Shadcn/ui Components](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components) - Complete component documentation\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: How to Integrate TanStack Router with Shadcn/ui\n---\n\nThis guide covers setting up Shadcn/ui with TanStack Router, including solutions for common animation and compatibility issues.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n**Time Required:** 30-45 minutes  \n**Difficulty:** Intermediate  \n**Prerequisites:** Existing TanStack Router project\n\n### What You'll Accomplish\n\n- Install and configure Shadcn/ui with TanStack Router\n- Fix animation issues with modals, sheets, and dialogs\n- Create type-safe navigation components\n- Set up proper styling integration\n- Resolve common compatibility problems\n\n---\n\n## Installation and Setup\n\n### Step 1: Install Shadcn/ui\n\n**Option 1: New project with TanStack Router template**\n\n```bash\nnpx create-tsrouter-app@latest my-app --template file-router --tailwind --add-ons shadcn\n```\n\n**Option 2: Add to existing TanStack Router project**\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest init\n```\n\n### Step 2: Configure components.json\n\nCreate or update your `components.json` for TanStack Router compatibility:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://ui.shadcn.com/schema.json\",\n  \"style\": \"default\",\n  \"rsc\": false,\n  \"tsx\": true,\n  \"tailwind\": {\n    \"config\": \"tailwind.config.js\",\n    \"css\": \"src/app/globals.css\",\n    \"baseColor\": \"slate\",\n    \"cssVariables\": true\n  },\n  \"aliases\": {\n    \"components\": \"@/components\",\n    \"utils\": \"@/lib/utils\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Add Essential Components\n\nInstall the most commonly used components:\n\n```bash\nnpx shadcn@latest add button\nnpx shadcn@latest add navigation-menu\nnpx shadcn@latest add sheet\nnpx shadcn@latest add dialog\n```\n\n---\n\n## Fixing Animation Issues\n\n### Step 1: Set Up Proper DOM Structure\n\nUpdate your root route to support portals and animations:\n\n```tsx\n// src/routes/__root.tsx\nimport { createRootRoute, Outlet } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\n\nexport const Route = createRootRoute({\n  component: () => (\n    <>\n      {/* Main content wrapper */}\n      <div id=\"root-content\">\n        <Outlet />\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Portal root for overlays */}\n      <div id=\"portal-root\"></div>\n\n      <TanStackRouterDevtools />\n    </>\n  ),\n})\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Sheet Component\n\nShadcn/ui Sheet components can have animation issues. Create a wrapper:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/router-sheet.tsx\nimport * as React from 'react'\nimport {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from '@/components/ui/sheet'\n\ninterface RouterSheetProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  trigger: React.ReactNode\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  onOpenChange?: (open: boolean) => void\n}\n\nexport function RouterSheet({\n  children,\n  trigger,\n  title,\n  description,\n  onOpenChange,\n}: RouterSheetProps) {\n  const [open, setOpen] = React.useState(false)\n\n  const handleOpenChange = (newOpen: boolean) => {\n    setOpen(newOpen)\n    onOpenChange?.(newOpen)\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <Sheet open={open} onOpenChange={handleOpenChange}>\n      <SheetTrigger asChild>{trigger}</SheetTrigger>\n      <SheetContent>\n        <SheetHeader>\n          <SheetTitle>{title}</SheetTitle>\n          {description && <SheetDescription>{description}</SheetDescription>}\n        </SheetHeader>\n        <div className=\"mt-4\">{children}</div>\n      </SheetContent>\n    </Sheet>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Step 3: Create Router-Compatible Dialog Component\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/router-dialog.tsx\nimport * as React from 'react'\nimport {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from '@/components/ui/dialog'\n\ninterface RouterDialogProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  trigger: React.ReactNode\n  title: string\n  description?: string\n  open?: boolean\n  onOpenChange?: (open: boolean) => void\n}\n\nexport function RouterDialog({\n  children,\n  trigger,\n  title,\n  description,\n  open: controlledOpen,\n  onOpenChange,\n}: RouterDialogProps) {\n  const [internalOpen, setInternalOpen] = React.useState(false)\n\n  const open = controlledOpen ?? internalOpen\n  const setOpen = onOpenChange ?? setInternalOpen\n\n  return (\n    <Dialog open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n      <DialogTrigger asChild>{trigger}</DialogTrigger>\n      <DialogContent>\n        <DialogHeader>\n          <DialogTitle>{title}</DialogTitle>\n          {description && <DialogDescription>{description}</DialogDescription>}\n        </DialogHeader>\n        <div className=\"mt-4\">{children}</div>\n      </DialogContent>\n    </Dialog>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Creating Navigation Components\n\n### Step 1: Router-Compatible Navigation Menu\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/navigation/main-nav.tsx\nimport { Link, useMatchRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { cn } from '@/lib/utils'\nimport {\n  NavigationMenu,\n  NavigationMenuItem,\n  NavigationMenuLink,\n  NavigationMenuList,\n  navigationMenuTriggerStyle,\n} from '@/components/ui/navigation-menu'\n\ninterface NavItem {\n  to: string\n  label: string\n  exact?: boolean\n}\n\ninterface MainNavProps {\n  items: NavItem[]\n  className?: string\n}\n\nexport function MainNav({ items, className }: MainNavProps) {\n  const matchRoute = useMatchRoute()\n\n  return (\n    <NavigationMenu className={className}>\n      <NavigationMenuList>\n        {items.map((item) => {\n          const isActive = matchRoute({ to: item.to, fuzzy: !item.exact })\n\n          return (\n            <NavigationMenuItem key={item.to}>\n              <Link\n                to={item.to}\n                className={cn(\n                  navigationMenuTriggerStyle(),\n                  isActive && 'bg-accent text-accent-foreground font-medium',\n                )}\n              >\n                {item.label}\n              </Link>\n            </NavigationMenuItem>\n          )\n        })}\n      </NavigationMenuList>\n    </NavigationMenu>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n### Step 2: Create Router-Compatible Button Links\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/ui/router-button.tsx\nimport { createLink } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { Button, type ButtonProps } from '@/components/ui/button'\nimport { forwardRef } from 'react'\n\n// Create a router-compatible Button\nexport const RouterButton = createLink(\n  forwardRef<HTMLButtonElement, ButtonProps>((props, ref) => {\n    return <Button ref={ref} {...props} />\n  }),\n)\n```\n\n### Step 3: Usage Example\n\n```tsx\n// src/routes/posts/index.tsx\nimport { createFileRoute } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { MainNav } from '@/components/navigation/main-nav'\nimport { RouterButton } from '@/components/ui/router-button'\nimport { RouterSheet } from '@/components/ui/router-sheet'\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'\n\nexport const Route = createFileRoute('/posts/')({\n  component: PostsPage,\n})\n\nconst navItems = [\n  { to: '/', label: 'Home' },\n  { to: '/posts', label: 'Posts', exact: true },\n  { to: '/about', label: 'About' },\n]\n\nfunction PostsPage() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"container mx-auto p-4\">\n      {/* Navigation with active states */}\n      <MainNav items={navItems} className=\"mb-8\" />\n\n      <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-6\">\n        <h1 className=\"text-3xl font-bold\">Posts</h1>\n\n        {/* Router-compatible button */}\n        <RouterButton to=\"/posts/new\" variant=\"default\">\n          Create Post\n        </RouterButton>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Sheet with proper animations */}\n      <RouterSheet\n        trigger={<Button variant=\"outline\">Open Menu</Button>}\n        title=\"Navigation Menu\"\n        description=\"Navigate through your posts\"\n      >\n        <div className=\"space-y-4\">\n          <p>This sheet animates correctly with TanStack Router!</p>\n          <RouterButton to=\"/posts/new\" variant=\"default\" className=\"w-full\">\n            Create New Post\n          </RouterButton>\n        </div>\n      </RouterSheet>\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Common Problems\n\n### Animation Components Not Working\n\n**Problem:** Sheet, Dialog, or other animated components don't animate properly.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Ensure proper portal setup:**\n\n   ```tsx\n   // Add to your index.html or root component\n   <div id=\"portal-root\"></div>\n   ```\n\n2. **Check CSS imports order:**\n\n   ```css\n   /* Make sure this comes before your custom styles */\n   @import 'tailwindcss/base';\n   @import 'tailwindcss/components';\n   @import 'tailwindcss/utilities';\n   ```\n\n3. **Use controlled components for complex animations:**\n\n   ```tsx\n   const [open, setOpen] = useState(false)\n\n   // Controlled instead of uncontrolled\n   <Sheet open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n   ```\n\n### TypeScript Errors with Router Integration\n\n**Problem:** TypeScript errors when using Shadcn/ui components with TanStack Router.\n\n**Solution:** Use `createLink` for proper typing:\n\n```tsx\nimport { createLink } from '@tanstack/react-router'\nimport { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'\n\n// This provides full type safety\nexport const RouterButton = createLink(Button)\n```\n\n### Styling Conflicts\n\n**Problem:** Shadcn/ui styles conflict with router or custom styles.\n\n**Solutions:**\n\n1. **Use CSS layers:**\n\n   ```css\n   @layer base, components, utilities;\n\n   @layer base {\n     /* Shadcn/ui base styles */\n   }\n\n   @layer components {\n     /* Your component styles */\n   }\n   ```\n\n2. **Increase specificity for router-specific styles:**\n   ```tsx\n   <Button className=\"router-active:bg-primary router-active:text-primary-foreground\">\n     Active Button\n   </Button>\n   ```\n\n### Dark Mode Integration\n\n**Problem:** Dark mode doesn't work properly with route changes.\n\n**Solution:** Set up theme provider correctly:\n\n```tsx\n// src/components/theme-provider.tsx\nimport { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState } from 'react'\n\ntype Theme = 'dark' | 'light' | 'system'\n\ninterface ThemeProviderProps {\n  children: React.ReactNode\n  defaultTheme?: Theme\n  storageKey?: string\n}\n\nconst ThemeProviderContext = createContext<{\n  theme: Theme\n  setTheme: (theme: Theme) => void\n}>({\n  theme: 'system',\n  setTheme: () => null,\n})\n\nexport function ThemeProvider({\n  children,\n  defaultTheme = 'system',\n  storageKey = 'ui-theme',\n}: ThemeProviderProps) {\n  const [theme, setTheme] = useState<Theme>(\n    () => (localStorage.getItem(storageKey) as Theme) || defaultTheme,\n  )\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const root = window.document.documentElement\n    root.classList.remove('light', 'dark')\n\n    if (theme === 'system') {\n      const systemTheme = window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)')\n        .matches\n        ? 'dark'\n        : 'light'\n      root.classList.add(systemTheme)\n      return\n    }\n\n    root.classList.add(theme)\n  }, [theme])\n\n  const value = {\n    theme,\n    setTheme: (theme: Theme) => {\n      localStorage.setItem(storageKey, theme)\n      setTheme(theme)\n    },\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <ThemeProviderContext.Provider value={value}>\n      {children}\n    </ThemeProviderContext.Provider>\n  )\n}\n\nexport const useTheme = () => {\n  const context = useContext(ThemeProviderContext)\n  if (context === undefined)\n    throw new Error('useTheme must be used within a ThemeProvider')\n  return context\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Production Checklist\n\nBefore deploying your Shadcn/ui + TanStack Router app:\n\n### Styling\n\n- [ ] All Shadcn/ui components render correctly\n- [ ] Animations work properly on route changes\n- [ ] Dark mode integration working (if applicable)\n- [ ] CSS conflicts resolved\n- [ ] Responsive design tested\n\n### Functionality\n\n- [ ] Navigation components work with router state\n- [ ] Active states properly reflected\n- [ ] TypeScript compilation successful\n- [ ] All sheets, dialogs, and modals animate correctly\n\n### Performance\n\n- [ ] Bundle size optimized (tree shaking working)\n- [ ] CSS-in-JS not causing performance issues\n- [ ] Animation performance acceptable on slower devices\n\n---\n\n## Related Resources\n\n- [Shadcn/ui TanStack Router Installation](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/installation/tanstack-router) - Official integration guide\n- [TanStack Router createLink API](../api/router#createlink) - API documentation for component integration\n- [Shadcn/ui Components](https://ui.shadcn.com/docs/components) - Complete component documentation\n"}
